#: crates/pdrive-app/src/main.rs:396
msgid "Sign-in failed"
msgstr "Échec de la connexion"

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/main.rs:396
msgid "The sign-in did not complete. Try again."
msgstr "La connexion n’a pas abouti. Réessayez."

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/main.rs:410
msgid "Sign-out failed"
msgstr "Échec de la déconnexion"

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/main.rs:410
msgid "The session could not be removed. See the logs of the application."
msgstr ""
"La session n’a pas pu être supprimée. Consultez les journaux de "
"l’application."

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/main.rs:423
msgid "Start PDrive when you log in?"
msgstr "Lancer PDrive à l’ouverture de session ?"

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/main.rs:423
msgid ""
"The Proton Drive folder is then mounted automatically. You can change this "
"in the settings."
msgstr ""
"Le dossier Proton Drive est alors monté automatiquement. Vous pouvez "
"modifier ce choix dans les réglages."

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/main.rs:424
msgid "Not now"
msgstr "Pas maintenant"

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/main.rs:424
msgid "Start at login"
msgstr "Lancer à l’ouverture de session"

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/main.rs:439
msgid "OK"
msgstr "OK"

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/settings.rs:14 crates/pdrive-app/src/tray.rs:100
#: crates/pdrive-app/src/window.rs:69
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Réglages"

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/settings.rs:17
msgid "Changes apply when the dialog is closed, restarting the service."
msgstr ""
"Les modifications s’appliquent à la fermeture de la fenêtre, avec un "
"redémarrage du service."

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/settings.rs:17
msgid "Synchronization"
msgstr "Synchronisation"

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/settings.rs:18
msgid "Mount point"
msgstr "Point de montage"

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/settings.rs:20
msgid "Cache size (GiB)"
msgstr "Taille du cache (Gio)"

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/settings.rs:28
msgid "Start when I log in"
msgstr "Lancer à l’ouverture de session"

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/settings.rs:32 crates/pdrive-app/src/settings.rs:40
msgid "Cannot change the startup setting"
msgstr "Impossible de modifier le réglage de démarrage"

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/settings.rs:36
msgid "Show the status window at startup"
msgstr "Ouvrir la fenêtre d’état au démarrage"

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/settings.rs:46
msgid "Account"
msgstr "Compte"

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/settings.rs:48 crates/pdrive-app/src/settings.rs:53
msgid "Sign out"
msgstr "Se déconnecter"

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/settings.rs:52
msgid "Sign out?"
msgstr "Se déconnecter ?"

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/settings.rs:52
msgid ""
"The service is stopped and the session is removed from this computer. "
"Pending uploads are resumed after the next sign-in."
msgstr ""
"Le service est arrêté et la session est supprimée de cet ordinateur. Les "
"envois en attente reprendront après la prochaine connexion."

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/settings.rs:53
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Annuler"

#: crates/pdrive-app/src/tray.rs:94 crates/pdrive-app/src/window.rs:197
#: crates/pdrived/src/dbus.rs:383
